[8] VERDICT INPUTS
  (i)   a->2pi: G'' ~ +3/(2pi-a)^2 -> +inf  (analytic + numeric, table [3])
  (ii)  G''(pi;2.5) = +0.0272769 > 0  (O28 0.0272768642),
        but beta*(pi) = 2.75237 => positive-at-a=pi only for beta<2.752
  (iii) a>0 negative window at beta=2.5: [0.709054, 2.973310], width 2.264256, depth -0.0791946
  (iv)  window widens monotonically with beta; left edge hits a=0 exactly at
        beta*(0)=4.30661; right edge -> 2pi with 2pi-a2 -> 0; depth -> -inf
  (v)   a=0 is positive for every beta < 4.30661  => for beta in [1/48, 2.5] the a=0
        statement is untouched by the negative window.
